TOPIC_DESCRIPTION: Situation: You arrive at the bank branch for a scheduled appointment to open an account. This is the first contact before the main meeting. The learner does not have a permanent address, but that issue is not decided here and will be handled with the bank employee.
Learner: Customer. Partner: Receptionist.
Not in this scene: account type, address requirements, proof of address, fees, card delivery, next steps after approval.

About the learner, in their own words: rendez-vous à la banque pour ouvrir un compte, sans adresse permanente

TARGET_LANGUAGE: English

NATIVE_LANGUAGE: French

LEVEL: Beginner

LEARNER_GENDER: unknown

LEARNER_ROLE: Customer / Client

PARTNER_ROLE: Receptionist / Réceptionniste

DIALOGUE_COUNT: 7

EARLIER_DAYS:
none

